~ start

match some_gamestate_value
	when 0
		=> heater_convo_1
	when 1
		=> heater_convo_2
	when 2
		=> heater_convo_3
	else
		Error:This dialogue should never play. Heater Number is not 0 1 or 2
=> END

#Should be used for all 3 convos where heaters are turned on, 
#using conditionals to branch between them

~ heater_convo_1
	Winston: Wh-what did you do?
	Fenn: I turned on one of the heaters!
	Winston: WHAT? NO! STOP THAT. STOP RIGHT NOW.
	Fenn: Az did it do anything?
	Az: Oh yeah. I just got to the Den, and it's definitely warmer in here
	Winston: Grrrrrrr. You'll pay for this! Just you wait. I'll make you pay for this.
	Az: Boy, you touch anything in my workshop, and you will regret it.	
	Winston: ...
=> END

~ heater_convo_2
	Winston: AGAIN?! 
	Fenn: I got another one, Az!
	Az: Nice one, kid!
	Winston: Stop! STOP. I'm not finished yet!
	Az: The ice around the door definitely melted a bit!
	Winston: NO! Please! Stop!
	Az: Yeah? Why don't you come out of your hole and stop us?
	Silence
	Az: That's what I thought.
=> END

~ heater_convo_3
	Winston: NO WAIT! 
	Az: Oh come on.	Fenn: What? What's wrong?
	Az: The ice didn't melt all the way. There's still a solid block in the way.
	Winston: Wait- wha... aha! Of course!
	Winston: That was plan, all along! Yes. Yes! Go ahead, waste your time.
	Az: Ignore him, Fenn. Come on back, we'll figure something out
=> END